# A downed player gets up for real - on their own machine and on the teammate's - however they went down:
# standing, mid-swing (an action that locks the stance queue), and in combat stance. "Back up" by every flag
# while still lying in the KnockOut mode is the failure this watches for (seen after the Great Tusk fight).

include session.coop

sleep 2

# Plain.
B hit me 5000
B expect ai me contains mode=KnockOut timeout=5
B expect ai me contains mode=Normal timeout=15
A expect ai DrovaCoop.Remote !contains mode=KnockOut timeout=10

# Mid-swing: the killing blow lands during a held attack.
B stance Combat
sleep 2
B press primaryattack 1.5
B hit me 5000
B expect ai me contains mode=KnockOut timeout=5
B expect ai me contains mode=Normal timeout=15
A expect ai DrovaCoop.Remote !contains mode=KnockOut timeout=10

# The host, in combat stance.
A stance Combat
sleep 2
A hit me 5000
A expect ai me contains mode=KnockOut timeout=5
A expect ai me contains mode=Normal timeout=15
B expect ai DrovaCoop.Remote !contains mode=KnockOut timeout=10

# The mode reads KnockOut a moment after the blow and Normal a moment after getting up.
# Standing players can walk again.
B walk 1 0 1
A walk -1 0 1
B expect ai me !contains mode=KnockOut timeout=5
A expect ai me !contains mode=KnockOut timeout=5
